    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/9d7854de2cb17f467a5b92cd1bce92b6.poster.avif?t=1724175895\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/9d7854de2cb17f467a5b92cd1bce92b6.webm?t=1724175895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/9d7854de2cb17f467a5b92cd1bce92b6.mp4?t=1724175895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Young Darwin is trapped in an unrelenting nightmare. Despite the Marelaw family's efforts, employing the finest doctors, true salvation lies beyond medicine - in Darwin's own willpower! He will find help in the profound bond he shares with his sister Lisa and the guidance of a mysterious owl\u2026 But the true escape lies deep and hidden within Darwin himself. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/065a32f8e993c8ad1701582d662ce076.poster.avif?t=1724175895\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/065a32f8e993c8ad1701582d662ce076.webm?t=1724175895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/065a32f8e993c8ad1701582d662ce076.mp4?t=1724175895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Join this eerie, dream-entwined journey in the Darwake world.<br>Darwin needs you... Help him wake from the endless nightmare!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/2a45c6dd4e83ce47913333bb47b87df4.avif?t=1724175895\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/9d7854de2cb17f467a5b92cd1bce92b6.poster.avif?t=1724175895\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/9d7854de2cb17f467a5b92cd1bce92b6.webm?t=1724175895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/9d7854de2cb17f467a5b92cd1bce92b6.mp4?t=1724175895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Young Darwin is trapped in an unrelenting nightmare. Despite the Marelaw family's efforts, employing the finest doctors, true salvation lies beyond medicine - in Darwin's own willpower! He will find help in the profound bond he shares with his sister Lisa and the guidance of a mysterious owl\u2026 But the true escape lies deep and hidden within Darwin himself. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/065a32f8e993c8ad1701582d662ce076.poster.avif?t=1724175895\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/065a32f8e993c8ad1701582d662ce076.webm?t=1724175895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/065a32f8e993c8ad1701582d662ce076.mp4?t=1724175895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Join this eerie, dream-entwined journey in the Darwake world.<br>Darwin needs you... Help him wake from the endless nightmare!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184850/extras/2a45c6dd4e83ce47913333bb47b87df4.avif?t=1724175895\" /></div>",
